Version 1.8.7 brings workout sharing by QR code and a redesigned library.
- Workout QR codes work again: show one or share it as an image.
- Scan a code with the camera, or import it from a screenshot or photo.
- The library is split into favorites, your workouts and starters.
- Workout pages show the work and rest time and the structure block by block.
- 11 new starter workouts.
- The phone now syncs with the watch automatically.
